 benefit from strong demand across key end markets, while Detection & Measurement delivered excellent profitability. Our results reflect the strength of our business model and the consistent execution of our teams.", "a": "Gene Lowe, President and CEO, remarked", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/88205/000008820526000060/q32026pressrelease.htm"}, {"d": "2026-07-30", "n": 4.84, "z": -0.46, "rz": 0.26, "earn": true, "q": "I’m very pleased with our second quarter performance, which reflected strong execution across both segments. We delivered significant year-over-year growth in revenue and operating income, driven by robust organic growth, continued demand across our key end markets, and meaningful contributions from our recent acquisit…", "a": "Gene Lowe, President and CEO, remarked", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/88205/000008820526000052/q22026pressrelease.htm"}, {"d": "2026-04-30", "n": 4.29, "z": -0.83, "rz": -0.31, "earn": true, "q": "We had a strong start to the year with growth in income from continuing operations and Adjusted EBITDA* in excess of 20%. We continue to see healthy demand across our key end markets and realize strong contributions from recent acquisitions. To reflect our strong first quarter performance and outlook for the remainder …", "a": "Gene Lowe, President and CEO, remarked", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/88205/000008820526000030/q12026pressrelease.htm"}, {"d": "2026-02-24", "n": 4.65, "z": -0.71, "rz": -0.06, "earn": true, "q": "I’m very pleased with our fourth quarter and full-year 2025 results, including Adjusted EBITDA* and Adjusted EPS* growth in excess of 20%. We continue to see healthy demand across our key end markets, execute well operationally, and realize strong contributions from recent acquisitions.", "a": "Gene Lowe, President and CEO, remarked", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/88205/000008820526000007/q42025pressrelease.htm"}, {"d": "2025-10-30", "n": 8.33, "z"